1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,700
销售系统上线后，商务主管林悦想把自己的履约经验做成智能体。
Sales lead Lin Yue wants to turn her fulfillment know-how into an agent.

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:11,600
她不会写代码，就在 Build 里选「智能体开发」，用大白话写下需求。
She can't code, so she picks Agent Builder in Build and writes in plain words.

3
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:18,100
接单先查信用，改 ERP 先存草稿，缺数据交给人，逾期 30 天才催收。
Check credit first, draft before ERP writes, hand gaps to people, chase after 30 days.

4
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:25,900
Build 调用 skill-builder，一起生成接单、履约、催收、月报四个技能。
Build generates four skills at once: intake, fulfillment, collection, monthly report.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:33,500
四个技能通过 MCP 接上金蝶 ERP，读写都走 ERP 原有的权限。
All four connect to Kingdee ERP via MCP, using ERP's existing permissions.

6
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:39,900
不到两分钟，销售履约智能体就生成了：交付摘要和智能体卡片。
In under two minutes, the sales fulfillment agent is ready.

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,300
她说的规矩变成了工作原则：改动 ERP 先存草稿，等人确认。
Her rules become working principles: draft first, confirm before submitting.

8
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:54,700
四个技能已绑定；运价表、催收函和网页报告模板上传为内置知识。
Skills are bound; rate card and report templates become built-in knowledge.

9
00:00:54,800 --> 00:01:01,900
附上一张客户采购单做本地测试，测试不触碰生产数据。
A local test with a real customer PO, without touching production data.

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,000
先查信用，再出订单草稿和网页预览，然后停下来问是否提交审核。
Credit check, then a draft order and web preview, then it asks before submitting.

11
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:19,000
测试通过后，林悦提交上架审核，审核通过即发布给销售团队。
Tests pass; Lin Yue submits it for review, and it is published to the sales team.

12
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:23,800
Build，让企业全员都能构建自己的智能体。
Build lets everyone in the enterprise build their own agents.
